{"product_id":"nasty-super-cool-mango-peach-ice-salt","title":"Nasty Super Cool - Mango Peach Ice Salt","description":"\u003cp\u003eDive into a frosty fusion with Mango Peach Ice Salt by Nasty Super Cool! This vibrant mix combines the tropical sweetness of ripe mangoes with the juicy zing of peaches, crowned by a chilling icy blast.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eNASTY Juice Super Cool series is engineered frost—not just typical menthol or mint. Each flavour delivers a signature chill that enhances without muting bold, juicy top notes. Designed for full-intensity coolness. it provides a crisp, clean sensation that refreshes the palate without overpowering, ensuring flavour hits cold and clean every time..\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSalt Details:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBottle Size: 30ML\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNicotine Strengths: 35MG \u0026amp; 50MG\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eType: Nicotine Salt E-liquid\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVG\/PG Ratio: 50\/50 – Best for pod devices\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBrand: Nasty Juice\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOrigin: Malaysia\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Nasty","offers":[{"title":"35MG","offer_id":42006260940855,"sku":"Nasty Super Cool - Mango Peach Ice - 35 MG","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"50MG","offer_id":42006260973623,"sku":"Nasty Super Cool - Mango Peach Ice - 50 MG","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/Mango-Peach-Ice_1024x1024_2x_3d2b51a4-4005-456b-9bfc-6e643147325c.webp?v=1764628407","url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/nasty-super-cool-mango-peach-ice-salt","provider":"[YOUR BRAND]","version":"1.0","type":"link"}




